/*
 * SCRN_AKE.C  Background screen maps: ake_scrn_data
 *
 * Pages of 16 x 16 cells, a cell being a character code and an attribute word. bg_cell_write
 * (bg000.c) and debug_bg_tile_put copy page `cell` of a map (the map's address + cell * 1024) into
 * a background layer, adding the layer's character base to every code and the given attribute to
 * every attribute. A stage background's map is bg_cg_src_tbl[bg_index] (etc_bg_cg_src_tbl[n] for
 * the other screens); the opening, ending and effect modules name their maps directly.
 *
 * Each map is [pages][16 rows][16 cells x (code, attribute)].
 */

